{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99831","id":2207239381,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Dj8zV","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99831","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99831.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99831.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99831","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99831/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99831/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99831/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/dd590a6a094f2ece6aac4955b209aa9b137c71e7","number":99831,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Make `SpinBox` tell parent container to sort children on `SpinBox` size change when inner LineEdit has `expand_to_text_length=true`","user":{"login":"KingTheFifth","id":57488573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NDg4NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57488573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingTheFifth","html_url":"https://github.com/KingTheFifth","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingTheFifth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingTheFifth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingTheFifth/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingTheFifth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingTheFifth/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingTheFifth/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingTheFifth/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingTheFifth/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingTheFifth/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fix #98761 \r\n\r\nWhen a `LineEdit` has `expand_to_text_length=true` and is in a container, the container will sort its children when the `LineEdit` changes size the text length changing. This behaviour was previously not present for `SpinBox` which relies on a `LineEdit`. Setting `expand_to_text_length=true` on the `LineEdit` of the `SpinBox` in GDScript would make the `SpinBox` change size on large input without the container sorting the children. This resulted in the `SpinBox` overlapping with other children of the container. This can be seen in the following video before this fix:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2773acc0-5e87-410b-9441-0e62780f9333\r\n\r\nWith this fix, the `SpinBox` behaves like a `LineEdit` when the inner `LineEdit` of the `SpinBox` is modified to have `expand_to_text_length=true`.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e924f383-e460-4e22-9a9c-33c0c339513c\r\n\r\nI have tested to make sure that the behaviour of `SpinBox` is consistent with that of `LineEdit` when `expand_to_text_length=false`.\r\n\r\nBefore the fix with `expand_to_text_length=false`:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1d4e105a-4bb8-4b8f-852d-c1c868893100\r\n\r\nAfter the fix with `expand_to_text_length=false`:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b0ba4a8a-e434-4a49-bc5d-abe903c03c1c\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":